✅ 4.sleep() vs join()

| Feature                       | `sleep()`                             | `join()`                          |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Purpose                       | Pause current thread for a fixed time | Wait for another thread to finish |
| Wait Depends On               | Time                                  | Thread completion                 |
| Releases Lock                 | ❌ No                                 | ❌ No                             |
| Static Method                 | ✅ Yes                                | ❌ No                             |
| Throws `InterruptedException` | ✅ Yes                                | ✅ Yes                            |
